# Raw flight logs. ~1300 files, several hundred MB, and they are working data
# rather than source: the curated cases that the thesis actually cites live in
# "test results raw material/test_results_designs/", outside this repo.
# Committing these once bloats the history permanently.
DataExchange/*.mat

